169
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:57,000
I'm trying to cut down on the amount of soda that I drink.

170
00:07:57,800 --> 00:08:01,500
Or I'm trying to cut down on how much I spend on the weekends.

171
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:02,340
Okay.

172
00:08:02,420 --> 00:08:05,160
So to cut down means to decrease or to lessen.

173
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:06,520
Very good.

174
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:13,500
And for our last phrase, the whole thing that we're talking about and one of the favorite meals for everyone, burger and fries.

175
00:08:14,140 --> 00:08:14,520
Okay.

176
00:08:14,520 --> 00:08:16,960
So this is one of many combinations for meals.

177
